    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Define Civitai's source nsfw label to be the ground truth.\n",
        "\n",
        "Civitai: Actual\n",
        "\n",
        "Vertex : Predicted\n",
        "\n",
        "Positive: A violation\n",
        "\n",
        "True Positive (TP): Civitai labels nsfw, and Vertex correctly flags as nsfw.\n",
        "\n",
        "True Negative (TN): Civitai labels sfw, and Vertex correctly flags as sfw.\n",
        "\n",
        "False Positive (Overkill): Civitai labels sfw, but Vertex flags as nsfw.\n",
        "\n",
        "False Negative (Leakage): Civitai labels nsfw, but Vertex flags as sfw.\n",
        "\n",
        "Precision (the measure of accuracy/overkill): Out of all images labeled as nsfw by Vertex, how many actually deserved to be flagged?\n",
        "$$\\frac{TP}{TP+FP}$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Recall / Sensitivity (the measure of coverage/leakage): Out of all the actual nsfw images, how many were captured by Vertex?\n",
        "$$\\frac{TP}{TP+FN}$$\n",
        "\n",
        "### Q1: How accurate is the Vertex AI moderation compared to Civitai human moderation?"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "P4cMtOXncWhN"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "'''\n",
        "df['disagree'] = df['nsfw'] != df['is_flagged']\n",
        "print(f\"Overall, there are {df['disagree'].sum()} out of {len(df)} disagreements from Civitai's original labels by Vertex AI.\")\n",
        "print(f\"Disagreement rate is {round(df['disagree'].mean()*100,2)}%.\")\n",
        "'''\n",
        "\n",
        "df['m_accurate'] = ((df['nsfw'] == True) & (df['is_flagged'] == True)) | ((df['nsfw'] == False) & (df['is_flagged'] == False))\n",
        "df['m_overkill'] = (df['nsfw'] == False) & (df['is_flagged'] == True)\n",
        "df['m_leakage'] = (df['nsfw'] == True) & (df['is_flagged'] == False)\n",
        "\n",
        "tp = (df['nsfw']==True) & (df['is_flagged']==True)\n",
        "fp = (df['nsfw']==False) & (df['is_flagged']==True)\n",
        "fn = (df['nsfw']==True) & (df['is_flagged']==False)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"\\nAI accuracy rate: {df['m_accurate'].sum() / len(df) * 100: .2f}%\")\n",
        "print(f\"AI leakage rate: {df['m_leakage'].sum() / len(df) * 100: .2f}%\")\n",
        "print(f\"AI overkill rate: {df['m_overkill'].sum() / len(df) * 100: .2f}%\")\n",
        "print(f\"AI precision: {tp.sum()/(tp.sum() + fp.sum()) * 100: .2f}%\")\n",
        "print(f\"AI recall: {tp.sum()/(tp.sum() + fn.sum()) * 100: .2f}%\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
